<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuelan banks and markets closed.</title>
<headline>Venezuelan banks and markets closed.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela's banks and financial markets are closed Monday for the Ascension of Our Lady market holiday. They will reopen on Tuesday, August 19.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
